      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://granitegod.com/whats-in-granite-city/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Port Harbor Railroad, a major junction at Niedringhaus Avenue and 16th Street, serves Granite City’s industrial businesses.",
